# Dreams of Laguna: "Surveil 1, then draw a card" (CR 701.25a), flashback {3}{U} (CR 702.34a). Hard cast with the top two
# cards Lightning Bolt and Counterspell: Bot1 puts the Bolt into the graveyard, so the draw takes Counterspell, the card
# that was under it (a draw before the surveil would have drawn the Bolt). Then it is cast from the graveyard with flashback
# for {3}{U}, the new top card, Mana Leak, is kept and drawn, and the card is exiled afterwards.

